      "text": "[8:47PM] #Anthony #TrafficUpdate \n\nOptimal traffic flow from the foot of Dorman Long Bridge to Fadeyi, Onipanu, Palm Grove, Obanikoro, and up to Anthony, with traffic moving smoothly.\nUncongested traffic conditions on Anthony inward Idiroko, Maryland, Odo Iyalaro, and up to New Garage, facilitating easy movement.\nEfficient traffic flow on the return journey from the Interchange and Motorway down to Ojota, with both the service lane and main carriageway operating smoothly, extending to New Garage, Odo Iyalaro, Independence Tunnel, and down to Idiroko and Anthony.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
